                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "20ce1b10-3802-3729-ac61-605f79f43a64",
                        "entry_id": "fb471e46-75cd-32c7-8420-42ffd5a3fc01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "bezlitośnie, surowo"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "91a1e92d-ef2d-4265-bf49-3dd62f0e06a3",
                                "sense_id": "20ce1b10-3802-3729-ac61-605f79f43a64",
                                "text": "Zima srogo nas tego roku potraktowała."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "280168e4-8d05-4727-aa7e-4b39b5bfe544",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb471e46-75cd-32c7-8420-42ffd5a3fc01",
                        "source_sense_id": "20ce1b10-3802-3729-ac61-605f79f43a64",
                        "target_lang_word": "cruelly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cruelly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d2a63b80-cfa8-3acd-ab19-9453cb41168f",
                                        "entry_id": "9da29def-f1ea-3c1a-8cd3-1f01fc7b6e7a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a cruel manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26e7e252-0711-4a75-a32f-c47fcc9db255",
                                                "sense_id": "d2a63b80-cfa8-3acd-ab19-9453cb41168f",
                                                "text": "In the meane time it chaunced, that Marcus Papyrius ſtroke one of the Galles on the heade with his ſtaffe, because he preſumed to ſtroke his bearde: with whiche iniurie the Gaulle beeing prouoked, ſlue Papyrius (as he ſate) with hys ſworde, and therewith the ſlaughter being begun with one, all the reſidue of thoſe auncient fatherly men as they ſat in theyr Chayres were ſlaine and cruelly murthered."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc8c4ef6-bd5c-4c97-b844-b8d28a9f6973",
                                                "sense_id": "d2a63b80-cfa8-3acd-ab19-9453cb41168f",
                                                "text": "Unfortunately, if certain national leaders have their way and repeal the Deferred Action for Childhood Arrivals (DACA) program, the American dreams of hundreds of thousands of young people will be cruelly ripped away."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fd12563c-72f2-4786-a647-784ac003d8ce",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb471e46-75cd-32c7-8420-42ffd5a3fc01",
                        "source_sense_id": "20ce1b10-3802-3729-ac61-605f79f43a64",
                        "target_lang_word": "dourly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dourly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d53ad215-a1ec-3f46-88b3-73a2155113d5",
                                        "entry_id": "529a1b17-75de-3c9b-9977-8e69f6811f95",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a dour manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b2e1a7ef-116e-4c74-a2bd-d5966dfea2a3",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb471e46-75cd-32c7-8420-42ffd5a3fc01",
                        "source_sense_id": "20ce1b10-3802-3729-ac61-605f79f43a64",
                        "target_lang_word": "severely",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "severely",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18755515-c890-37e4-9d69-c0bb25ddb68d",
                                        "entry_id": "2ccf1c65-1752-3d6a-851e-3223a83c00ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a severe manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5038b5c3-08fd-4fe2-9b49-e95ff0acca2f",
                                                "sense_id": "18755515-c890-37e4-9d69-c0bb25ddb68d",
                                                "text": "After the first day they left her severely alone, their plea to their husbands, her uncompromising independence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85b7f306-3b20-4a1c-8e22-4f387247ade8",
                                                "sense_id": "18755515-c890-37e4-9d69-c0bb25ddb68d",
                                                "text": "Meanwhile the Christian Church from these speculations has kept itself severely apart - as of course representing a unique and divine revelation little concerned or interested in such heathenisms[.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1ac5591-f352-4a92-b403-2b9257fef766",
                                                "sense_id": "18755515-c890-37e4-9d69-c0bb25ddb68d",
                                                "text": "Regular freight trains between Abergavenny and Merthyr were withdrawn on November 24, 1954, because it was found both practicable and more economical to send this traffic by less severely-graded routes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dcb4d445-bfa7-4f98-83c6-ceacffaacb14",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb471e46-75cd-32c7-8420-42ffd5a3fc01",
                        "source_sense_id": "20ce1b10-3802-3729-ac61-605f79f43a64",
                        "target_lang_word": "hardly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hardly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5fbc8ba-d20b-3d6b-95f6-3c109f9b046e",
                                        "entry_id": "ba34ebd5-3f92-33d5-85c1-bd9687de851f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Barely, only just, almost not."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dbc64f0-0d04-413a-b6b4-2468c3defa70",
                                                "sense_id": "f5fbc8ba-d20b-3d6b-95f6-3c109f9b046e",
                                                "text": "They hardly ever watch television."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e11a184-c869-4af2-b2c4-b0277b6b3c42",
                                                "sense_id": "f5fbc8ba-d20b-3d6b-95f6-3c109f9b046e",
                                                "text": "It's hardly possible he could lose the election."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7810b1da-8b27-4127-9763-96122912a36e",
                                                "sense_id": "f5fbc8ba-d20b-3d6b-95f6-3c109f9b046e",
                                                "text": "Hardly did I arrive when he left."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "533b1569-90de-4cd1-a4a6-4bf2defc40af",
                                                "sense_id": "f5fbc8ba-d20b-3d6b-95f6-3c109f9b046e",
                                                "text": "How lonely they looked as they lay there, and how ill assorted! That little heap had been for two thousand years the wisest, loveliest, proudest creature - I can hardly call her woman - in the whole universe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb68ce87-0e3b-3a33-8b24-940d55e910fc",
                                        "entry_id": "ba34ebd5-3f92-33d5-85c1-bd9687de851f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Certainly not; not at all."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "239a05e8-daf0-4811-8e4a-7fb0a5238309",
                                                "sense_id": "fb68ce87-0e3b-3a33-8b24-940d55e910fc",
                                                "text": "I hardly think they'll come in this bad weather!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f23d5ed-da99-4a7e-ba6f-c742279ddd91",
                                                "sense_id": "fb68ce87-0e3b-3a33-8b24-940d55e910fc",
                                                "text": "With this the second of three games in seven days for Stoke, it was hardly surprising to see nine changes from the side that started against Newcastle in the Premier League on Monday."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c60b62a6-7543-4485-b953-1b95ece74f36",
                                                "sense_id": "fb68ce87-0e3b-3a33-8b24-940d55e910fc",
                                                "text": "Investors face a quandary. Cash offers a return of virtually zero in many developed countries; government-bond yields may have risen in recent weeks but they are still unattractive. Equities have suffered two big bear markets since 2000 and are wobbling again. It is hardly surprising that pension funds, insurers and endowments are searching for new sources of return."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f78af57f-df19-3828-8cbe-54699b3a4901",
                                        "entry_id": "ba34ebd5-3f92-33d5-85c1-bd9687de851f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "With difficulty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1103ead-7834-4756-a824-f6c230808372",
                                                "sense_id": "f78af57f-df19-3828-8cbe-54699b3a4901",
                                                "text": "And what gentle flame soever doth warme the heart of young virgins, yet are they hardly drawne to leave and forgoe their mothers, to betake them to their husbands […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64307183-296b-44ff-b535-e97145a2f664",
                                                "sense_id": "f78af57f-df19-3828-8cbe-54699b3a4901",
                                                "text": "While in Chelsea, Anne Smiley pined, taking very hardly to her unaccustomed role of wife abandoned."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a4ffbbe-5bb3-37b6-b304-b4a53226c2ec",
                                        "entry_id": "ba34ebd5-3f92-33d5-85c1-bd9687de851f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Harshly, severely; in a hard manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab45d19a-4c60-4cbd-98dd-162f9eb70963",
                                                "sense_id": "1a4ffbbe-5bb3-37b6-b304-b4a53226c2ec",
                                                "text": "I was a fool when I married him; and I am so far an incurable fool on that subject, that, for the sake of what I once believed him to be, I wouldn’t have even this shadow of my idle fancy hardly dealt with."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fb5a34d-bc80-4c7f-b537-ec782ea2de8b",
                                                "sense_id": "1a4ffbbe-5bb3-37b6-b304-b4a53226c2ec",
                                                "text": "\"Mr. Cholmondeley, the young men out here are much too hardly worked to allow them time for paying impertinent compliments.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cd6c1f5-4803-4860-becb-ebd0e79965ef",
                                                "sense_id": "1a4ffbbe-5bb3-37b6-b304-b4a53226c2ec",
                                                "text": "Only I wasn't at all pleased with that; I saw that he was simply sorry for me because I was so hardly treated by grandmother, and that was all."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c2baf242-fe61-3b67-ae17-c6aaea2e56fd",
                                        "entry_id": "ba34ebd5-3f92-33d5-85c1-bd9687de851f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Firmly, vigorously, with strength or exertion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4d624d3-ffa4-49de-9f66-718a9c747d0e",
                                                "sense_id": "c2baf242-fe61-3b67-ae17-c6aaea2e56fd",
                                                "text": "Let him hardly be possest with an honest curiositie to search out the nature and causes of all things […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e783f7a-9ed9-4512-98ed-2ca2c1954690",
                                                "sense_id": "c2baf242-fe61-3b67-ae17-c6aaea2e56fd",
                                                "text": "Sometimes my pulse beat so quickly and hardly, that I felt the palpitation of every artery; at others, I nearly sank to the ground through languor and extreme weakness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "hardly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "068567fa-54fe-3ea2-8e30-6061d421bd2a",
                                        "entry_id": "815a44e3-e868-31d4-9011-2bd0cf165861",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not really."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7b0f9df-70c0-4468-bf6b-ab6426aabc8f",
                                                "sense_id": "068567fa-54fe-3ea2-8e30-6061d421bd2a",
                                                "text": "I think the Beatles are a really overrated band. ― Hardly!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "69aab38b-bad4-4898-b24c-bf1e1857012d",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb471e46-75cd-32c7-8420-42ffd5a3fc01",
                        "source_sense_id": "20ce1b10-3802-3729-ac61-605f79f43a64",
                        "target_lang_word": "sévèrement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sévèrement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "22bdea48-6b26-38eb-8017-e0a3efdd86fb",
                                        "entry_id": "3864e2db-2d5b-35fc-b6b3-bd3441fcf0b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière sévère ; avec sévérité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d0563da-3191-4c30-a581-b25828a576e5",
                                                "sense_id": "22bdea48-6b26-38eb-8017-e0a3efdd86fb",
                                                "text": "Réponds de toi-même, frère, ajouta le roi Richard un peu sévèrement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10357723-0945-4425-ae4b-aa732b52e146",
                                                "sense_id": "22bdea48-6b26-38eb-8017-e0a3efdd86fb",
                                                "text": "[…], je lui dictais sévèrement des choses ennuyeuses qu'elle tapait avec une application timide, toute frêle, toute mièvre dans sa robe de confection simili popeline."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78a93960-5fae-43a5-b7ff-d051022c9e4a",
                                                "sense_id": "22bdea48-6b26-38eb-8017-e0a3efdd86fb",
                                                "text": "As-tu pris tes médicaments, mon papounet ? demanda-t-elle sévèrement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08d99018-f9bb-46ee-b85d-c65ebba5a5f2",
                                                "sense_id": "22bdea48-6b26-38eb-8017-e0a3efdd86fb",
                                                "text": "La politique romaine, qui défendait si sévèrement les religions étrangères,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1115757b-1d7c-44a0-a6eb-cec176ebba9f",
                                                "sense_id": "22bdea48-6b26-38eb-8017-e0a3efdd86fb",
                                                "text": "Ce fut un scandale effroyable dans un diocèse administré très sévèrement. Les prêtres, en bonne règle, ne doivent faire des enfants qu’à des femmes mariées. Pour avoir manqué à cette loi de convenance, il fut mis en prison, diffamé, chassé."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a443487-a48c-3443-92f3-e23b81797ef1",
                                        "entry_id": "3864e2db-2d5b-35fc-b6b3-bd3441fcf0b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Beaucoup, avec insistance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4908658e-d00a-43e5-a1d0-6c6cb1e02571",
                                                "sense_id": "3a443487-a48c-3443-92f3-e23b81797ef1",
                                                "text": "Il commençait à me taper sévèrement sur le système avec ses airs supérieurs, le frisé à lunettes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "476ed7a9-ddb7-3372-9043-5dc62492513e",
                                        "entry_id": "3864e2db-2d5b-35fc-b6b3-bd3441fcf0b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Avec un goût sévère."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92e8bb53-aa4d-4213-ac27-1a8c42a63976",
                                                "sense_id": "476ed7a9-ddb7-3372-9043-5dc62492513e",
                                                "text": "Cela est écrit sévèrement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b97f8f65-1650-4630-ae47-c1c63e0e84a8",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb471e46-75cd-32c7-8420-42ffd5a3fc01",
                        "source_sense_id": "20ce1b10-3802-3729-ac61-605f79f43a64",
                        "target_lang_word": "жестоко",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "жестоко",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6da04456-89e6-30f0-b8a3-fc9910d1db31",
                                        "entry_id": "5b78c30b-ba63-30d4-a09c-4030975b336b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "наречие к жестокий; крайне сурово; грубо, беспощадно, безжалостно"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "adverb"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "527dd956-4718-4db5-ab89-6369a5d38226",
                                                "sense_id": "6da04456-89e6-30f0-b8a3-fc9910d1db31",
                                                "text": "Это ― хороший человек, и он жестоко обижен; жизнь обращалась с ним несправедливо, как мачеха с пасынком."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3b434e7-c88e-39e0-94f4-26abbc9c0365",
